{
 "duration": 56.45,
 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "text": "Pipes can freeze inside your kitchen cabinet.",
   "end": 2.8
  },
  {
   "start": 2.8,
   "text": "Lose power, and the risk climbs.",
   "end": 5.19
  },
  {
   "start": 5.19,
   "text": "But why there?",
   "end": 6.48
  },
  {
   "start": 6.48,
   "text": "The Red Cross lists kitchen cabinets along with attics and garages.",
   "end": 10.54
  },
  {
   "start": 10.54,
   "text": "So follow the cold.",
   "end": 12.25
  },
  {
   "start": 12.25,
   "text": "It hits an outside wall with thin insulation.",
   "end": 15.23
  },
  {
   "start": 15.23,
   "text": "In this house, the heat went out with the power.",
   "end": 17.84
  },
  {
   "start": 17.84,
   "text": "Then the cold finds the sink.",
   "end": 19.79
  },
  {
   "start": 19.79,
   "text": "Its pipe runs along that wall, behind a closed door.",
   "end": 23.34
  },
  {
   "start": 23.34,
   "text": "Cold wall. Closed door.",
   "end": 25.37
  },
  {
   "start": 25.37,
   "text": "No warm air. That's why the cabinet.",
   "end": 28.07
  },
  {
   "start": 28.07,
   "text": "The usual tip?",
   "end": 29.12
  },
  {
   "start": 29.12,
   "text": "Open the doors, so warmer air gets in.",
   "end": 31.75
  },
  {
   "start": 31.75,
   "text": "But in this house, there's none.",
   "end": 33.66
  },
  {
   "start": 33.66,
   "text": "So when it's very cold out, let cold water drip from that faucet.",
   "end": 38.11
  },
  {
   "start": 38.11,
   "text": "The Red Cross says even a little running water helps.",
   "end": 41.27
  },
  {
   "start": 41.27,
   "text": "Open the tap and only a trickle comes out?",
   "end": 43.64
  },
  {
   "start": 43.64,
   "text": "Suspect a frozen pipe.",
   "end": 45.58
  },
  {
   "start": 45.58,
   "text": "Water expands as it freezes, and pipes can break.",
   "end": 49.08
  },
  {
   "start": 49.08,
   "text": "IBHS says shut off the water supply.",
   "end": 51.99
  },
  {
   "start": 51.99,
   "text": "Know where your main shut-off is.",
   "end": 53.9
  },
  {
   "start": 53.9,
   "text": "Never thaw a pipe with an open flame.",
   "end": 56.45
  }
 ],
